menu "HomePi OTA"
    config HOMEPI_OTA_ROLLBACK_TEST
        bool "Rollback test image: never connect to the broker"
        default n
        help
            Builds an image that boots, never connects to MQTT and therefore never confirms itself:
            after the 10-minute confirmation deadline it restarts and the bootloader reverts to the
            previous image. Used once to prove the rollback; never shipped.
endmenu
